{"4275430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexagon Madness", "steam_appid": 4275430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagon Madness offers players a challenging single-player, first-person 3D platformer. Surviving rising and dropping platforms without falling off into the void. Face 60 rounds of unforgiving obstacles determined to stop you from reaching the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each round comes a new obstacle or aid such as items to help the player survive. In between rounds, the player can upgrade his inventory of items using the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, as the player progresses, they can unlock new content such as game modes like the sandbox mode to create their own custom rounds. Unlock a model viewer in the Gallery section to observe each obstacle, item, upgrade and many more. The player can also play a tutorial mode to better understand the obstacles they've unlocked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to your survival lies in mastering quick decision-making and resourcefulness. Hexagon Madness incorporates dynamic physics that you can use to your advantage, allowing you to overcome every obstacle and survive through this challenge more effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagon Madness was created under the challenge of developing without planning or coordination between developers. Much like a game of telephone, each developer worked on the project for one week with no communication before passing it on to the next.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagon Madness offers players a challenging single-player, first-person 3D platformer. Surviving rising and dropping platforms without falling off into the void. Face 60 rounds of unforgiving obstacles determined to stop you from reaching the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each round comes a new obstacle or aid such as items to help the player survive. In between rounds, the player can upgrade his inventory of items using the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/f8d4c682161204dba4243d5de79f8e3d.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, as the player progresses, they can unlock new content such as game modes like the sandbox mode to create their own custom rounds. Unlock a model viewer in the Gallery section to observe each obstacle, item, upgrade and many more. The player can also play a tutorial mode to better understand the obstacles they've unlocked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/3e4e6269bee2d5ff20eb73fb9ef4ddf6.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to your survival lies in mastering quick decision-making and resourcefulness. Hexagon Madness incorporates dynamic physics that you can use to your advantage, allowing you to overcome every obstacle and survive through this challenge more effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.poster.avif?t=1770212993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.webm?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/extras/ec2c0ec18448856ddfcca17c297033ff.mp4?t=1770212993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagon Madness was created under the challenge of developing without planning or coordination between developers. Much like a game of telephone, each developer worked on the project for one week with no communication before passing it on to the next.</p>", "short_description": "Hexagon Madness offers players a challenging single-player, first-person 3D platformer. Surviving rising and dropping platforms without falling off into the void. Face 60 rounds of unforgiving obstacles determined to stop you from reaching the end.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/da88001d67e247078361bedefd973b1b20a5f80c/header.jpg?t=1770212993", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275430/aeaeb48674549889a86d6f2c2c6a69d2b785708d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=177